{"id":"vod_sn_37228","vodId":"37228","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我自己；你自己","name_cn":"我自己；你自己","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8fd66d9ec9c273984bb49871a84ec876.jpg"},"summary":"今天，日高佐菜（立花慎之介 配音）回到了曾经居住过的小镇上，他即将在那个充满了欢乐回忆的地方开始新的生活。可是，今日的日高早已不同于往日，曾经饱受欺辱的日子彻底改变了他单纯的性格，更有一道永远无法抹去的伤疤要陪伴日高度过他的余生。　　在小镇上，日高遇见了曾经的初恋对象八代菜菜香（小清水亚美 配音），从前活泼可爱的她，如今却变成了少言寡语态度冷淡的傲娇女，这些年究竟发生了什么使得她发生了如此巨大的变化呢？在善于插科打诨的好友若月修辅（子安武人 配音）的陪伴下，日高找回了昔日的快乐时光，但总有一份不安在心中默默的酝酿。日高知道，一场回忆的狂风暴雨即将袭来。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/q5pj0yYauB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PZM0bxZH2S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VnXST6kw1u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Dm4uJ9AcAj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SiuZf3RXvN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/qqE1uRP9qL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jSXHv3z30G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9XPZrpkQH51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/diYPXGQThE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bdLRyfVFWb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jjtn95nUFG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/AfmDk0vfHy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zWsQ97ZwHT1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:13.708Z"}